e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9wRemUSkn38Q7kNvwHAPVAc&_nc_oc=Adqo91gEW0PQ6DnMGePvqIG4IWUm-izV2tYeohS8luxh9A63DdrBmRxnRVp0DkCMq6Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af3mjgk1ftWbRhGUsaVHInwBFH5eG92UzMd0KPcYBH8GwQ&oe=69F8B679"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mFN3F25Jgd8Q7kNvwEVFWhT&_nc_oc=AdrqIVpJWR_MpvyAmVdr4w29r_ZYm2GUJVczZp8f53JDFRYiy6-58gHVSuK0ABohE-U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0LYgafQsO2tXbmKR-nSAQ19DrdjVLZdbc8zczz4wDh7g&oe=69F88DD3"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1jM5TpQwpXcQ7kNvwEqh1cj&_nc_oc=Adou7vOq6ehSR4Fo5Bjrvz3gxIczwyHU0YkXqqyM29ln0e09O34BadvzxCRDdp6E0Vk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1Iz14Yh7XjrwQ4bpVkVZeIoryZEZFtCnN0UjZYgjt7Lg&oe=69F8997B"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C3xHjp6Ws_sQ7kNvwHKw4H1&_nc_oc=AdrnIeMEZnBQzcwKh_VcjiZHoUuV-NDHaJhG3VYKq5p94I_xyy6KKUkkxvY118df4Pw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2ikrbzFa-3dohqYc7nlMIoF_X4842JtIdDkWqaNXUwTA&oe=69F89ACA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Y5xV_mlsE4YQ7kNvwF2DLg1&_nc_oc=AdrukJolUBUMCr34MTdAgGhVIAObAn8_P-MqzQ2X15rgiyDCgm3DWHaXejkY3LrKTfM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af34YNJVqygLsDgqjK3PB3f6EiiTIvG5E_g-TzHu2omXag&oe=69F8BC3E"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se